Create a Plan with:
- A clear, bounded title (e.g., "Implement user authentication with JWT" not "Make auth work")
- A description explaining what this achieves, why it matters, and what is explicitly out of scope
- 3-5 measurable acceptance criteria — each must be independently testable (e.g., "All endpoints return 401 for unauthenticated requests" not "Auth works")

Respond with a JSON array containing a single `create_plan` action.
